name=Show Healing Progress
id=PZShowHealingProgress
author=kaleido4
modversion=1.1.0
versionMin=42.0.0
poster=poster.png
icon=icon.png
description=Shows how far each wound has healed in the Health tab, under the body part. <LINE>
description=Ex: "- Fracture: 45% healed" <LINE>
description= <LINE>
description=Works for scratches, lacerations, deep wounds, bites, burns, fractures and stitches. A body part with several wounds gets one line per wound. <LINE>
description=When a wound is healed, the line stays at 100% while a bandage, stitches or a splint is still on the body part, so you know it can come off. Once you take it off, the line goes away. <LINE>
description=Stitches show 100% once they can be removed safely. Removing them earlier reopens the deep wound. <LINE>
description=A deep wound that stopped healing says why: it needs a bandage, or there is still glass inside. <LINE>
description= <LINE>
description=<H2>Sandbox options <LINE>
description=<TEXT>* Required First Aid Level: the skill level needed to see the healing progress, 0 to 10. 0 means anyone can see it. When treating another player, the level of the one treating counts. <LINE>
description=* Text Color: the color of the healing progress line. Light blue by default. <LINE>
description= <LINE>
description=Works in SP. <LINE>
description=Should work in MP, but it was not tested. <LINE>
description=Can be added to existing saves. Wounds you already have show an estimate (~) because the mod did not see how bad they were at the start. <LINE>
description=Does not replace game files.
